@host = http://localhost:9090/api
@uri = {{host}}/idiomas-guia
@token = PEGAR_AQUI_EL_TOKEN_DEL_LOGIN

### Listar idiomas de los guías
GET {{uri}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Insertar con JSON inválido (400)
POST {{uri}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### Ana habla Inglés
POST {{uri}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "guia_id": 2,
    "idioma_id": 2
}

### Insertar con ids negativos (400)
POST {{uri}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "guia_id": -1,
    "idioma_id": -2
}

### Insertar con un idioma que no existe (422 desde datos)
POST {{uri}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "guia_id": 1,
    "idioma_id": 9999
}

###
